{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10920","headline":"前苦寒行二首 一 · 杜甫","name":"前苦寒行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉时长安雪一丈，牛马毛寒缩如蝟。\n楚江巫峡冰入怀，虎豹哀号又堪记。\n秦城老翁荆扬客，惯习炎蒸岁絺綌。\n玄冥祝融气或交，手持白羽未敢释。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}